<h5><b>Future of Journal Indexing and Evaluation</b></h5>
<br>International Magazine Directory (IMD) indexes and evaluates local and international magazines and journals. 

Once a journal applied for indexing in IMD, evaluation and indexing of journal is started. It also will be indexed in 22 other new online libraries.
The journal will be evaluated and quality is estimated based on 22 comprehensive defined standards.
After indexing the journal all article abstracts of the journal will be indexed in 33 online article libraries. Also Journal IMD-Score will be computation based on check list will be displayed on the journal profile on IDM website.
International Journal Identifier (IJI) The modern alternative of DOI which does not have problems of DOI will be assign to the journal. International Class Indetifier (ICI) a unique category code for the journal will be assigned and displayed on journal profile.
International IOI Identifier (IOI) will be assiged to all articles of the journal.

