<h5><b>International Magazine Directory Coverage:</b></h5>

<p>IDM is an open access international journal and magazine directory cover all fields of science with a strong review process, rapid, and on time indexing of local and international journals and magazines</p>

<h5><b>Evaluation Ethics and Evaluation Malpractice Statement:</b></h5>

The IMD evaluation team evaluates a journal/magazine based on standards regardless of country and langauge of the magazines. The evaluation process performed neutrally. Evaluation team issues views about the magazine clearly with supporting opinions. 
Also the journal/magazine score (IMD-Score) which is an average of some factors will be graded. The evaluation team also will consider similarity or overlap between the content the journa/magazine under evaluation and other journal/magazines. 

